> Build tooling note: this package uses a **plain Node ESM build** (`scripts/build.mjs` →
> `tsc` + copy vendored `dap/js-debug`/`dap/debugpy` into `lib/`). There is **no tsdown/bundler**.
> For tsserver to work, the workspace must resolve a `typescript@5` with `lib/tsserver.js`;
> see the runbook skill (section *tsserver 的标准修法*).

